  "description": "Enhance Compatible with your Toyota Grand Highlander 2024-2026 with OEDRO's custom-fit all-weather TPE floor mats and cargo liner. These precision-engineered mats provide complete edge-to-edge protection from mud, snow, and spills, while their recyclable, pet-friendly TPE material ensures durability and safety. Designed with the vehicle’s aesthetics in mind, these mats blend perfectly with your interior. Cleaning is hassle-free—simply remove, shake off, and hose down. Backed by over a decade of expertise in auto accessories, OEDRO guarantees top-tier quality and fitment, offering unparalleled protection for your Grand Highlander.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Grand Highlander 2024-2026: Precisely designed to accommodate the factory subwoofer and 7-seat layout, ensuring perfect coverage, secure fit, and no interference with your vehicle’s premium audio system.\nEco-Friendly Materials: Made from durable, recyclable TPE, ensuring sustainability and safety for your family.\nAll-Weather Protection: High-edged design effectively shields your vehicle from mud, snow, and spills.\nEasy to Clean: Non-slip mats are easy to maintain—just hose down or wipe clean with a damp cloth.\nComplete Set: Includes mats for the front and second rows, plus a cargo liner, offering full interior coverage.\n2-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024-2026 Toyota Grand Highlander (7 Seaters Only).\nIncludes Hybrid Models",
